				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607526611" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;" >The Great Hippo</a></span> <span class="odate time_1525532772 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">05 May 2018 15:06</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3791297">
									

<p>There's a few (relatively minor) hiccups; I feel like portions of this could be polished and tightened a bit more. But all in all, the prose here is <em>excellent</em> &#8212; a bit thicker than my preference, but I'm a minimalist at heart. I'm genuinely shocked this has as low of a rating as it does, particularly given the dearth of strong, well-written prose we have on this site.</p>
<p>I will say it gives me a strong &quot;<em>Tom Clancy Presents: THE FOUNDATION</em>&quot; vibe, which &#8212; okay, that's maybe a bit of a backhanded compliment, but the meticulous violence of the narrative is served quite well by the dense prose. There's numerous little flourishes here in your language that I really, <em>really</em> liked.</p>
<p>(Also: Your URL link to the next piece was broken, so I fixed it!)</p>

